{
  //normal quests

  "Examples": "",

  "CL_NM name": "",
  "CL_NM description": "",
  "CL_NMtaskN": "",
  "CL_NM successMT": "",
  "CL_NM acceptMT": "",

  "6822ee4e7aa83d1c4f1fa658 name": "Found",
  "6822ee4e7aa83d1c4f1fa658 description": "'I must say, you've got quite an eye for things. You've found no shortage of things in this place, and most importantly, you've found yourself here to begin with. Where is here, you ask? Well, that depends on who you ask. To some, it's hell. To some, it's paradise. For me, well, I simply find myself here like you. Though I suppose I'm here in a different way than you. You see, I am actaully an angel. Yes, a heavenly angel, sent by God to this place. Better yet, I've been sent to find you.' The voice pauses, and you ask it what it means when it says it was sent to find you. 'Well... why don't you get a fire going and get comfortable. I have a lot to explain to you.'",
  "6826db07ba1d8306c83e1ebd": "Hand over any flammable material",
  "6822ee4e7aa83d1c4f1fa658 successMT": "(See next quest)",
  "6822ee4e7aa83d1c4f1fa658 acceptMT": "This is not what I was expecting, to say the least.",

  "6826b7202c16346abc2ad74b name": "Awoken",
  "6826b7202c16346abc2ad74b description": "'Would you believe me if I said we find ourselves in similar situations?' You feel something sizing you up. 'Both of us here without being sure why, both of us suddenly in contact with an otherworldly entity, both... ...what? You don't know? My friend, you are *definitely* a special being. As a matter of fact, a lot of things are special about this place. It's... well, it's a long story. Before I get too far, let me introduce myself, though. I am an angel, sent from heaven. Yep, straight from God. This place has gotten in quite a situation, I'm here on His behalf to make sure things work out. Well, sort of. I can't do it myself, I need you.' You ask why it might need you. 'Well, that's a long story. Why don't you get comfortable?'",
  "6826b7237c0e0b12626f6a46": "Hand over any flammable material",
  "6826b7202c16346abc2ad74b successMT": "(See next quest)",
  "6826b7202c16346abc2ad74b acceptMT": "This is anything *but* a break, frnakly.",

  "6910a175001d831c44bccdc0 name": "The Lower-pitched Voice.",
  "6910a175001d831c44bccdc0 description": "You call out to the lower-pitched voice. You aren't sure how to make it clear which one you're calling out to, you just sort of... intend it towards that one. 'Hello', the voice says peacefully, comfortably. 'I was wondering when you would respond to me. You seem to be doing alright for yourself, despite of the fact you died earlier. You- ...oh, you didn't know? That wasn't a hallucination, friend. You died, 100%. Pretty gnarly, too. Yet, you're still here. ...yeah, I should probably discuss some things with you.'",
  "6910a188d2785ef150b8a692": "Continue the story",
  "6910a175001d831c44bccdc0 successMT": "(See next quest)",
  "6910a175001d831c44bccdc0 acceptMT": "How are they gonna know which one I'm- well that worked.",

  "691449e608b5ececdc4cf214 name": "Association",
  "691449e608b5ececdc4cf214 description": "'Hello.' You hear the lower pitched voice calling out to you, separated from the other and clear as a sunny day. 'Hello, dear friend. Can you hear me alright?' The voice seems rather calm, though clearly seeking an answer. It fades in and out, traded with the other voice. You get the sense that they are separated for good now, and that calling out to both won't work this time.",
  "691449eaa17ca46f53ea0d94": "It seems you can only pick one...",
  "691449e608b5ececdc4cf214 successMT": "'Oh, good. I wasn't sure if I was able to speak with you or not.' The voice remains rather calm, almost as if they were sure you would pick them. Did they even know there was a choice? 'Sit down, make yourself comfortable. You have questions, and I have answers.'",
  "691449e608b5ececdc4cf214 acceptMT": "Which one...",

  "691513f45ebf06cb9e158393 name": "Conversation with an Otherwordly Being(3)",
  "691513f45ebf06cb9e158393 description": "'I should probably take a minute to actually explain who I am, shouldn't I? Well, I am actually an angel sent from Heaven. Yes, the big place in the sky, straight from God Himself. Do not be afraid, I have not come to judge you. I've actually come to work with you. Yes, *you*. One could say you're the `main character` of this place. As to why that is... well, that's a whole other story. You might as well get comfortable if I'm gonna keep rambling.'",
  "691513f3fea480dfaa632c5b": "Hand over any flammable material",
  "691513f45ebf06cb9e158393 successMT": "'Glad to see you sticking around. Hope you don't mind more of my ranting.'",
  "691513f45ebf06cb9e158393 acceptMT": "Casually chatting with an otherwordly being",

  "682f7d5c4ae9cfa71f1cc79c name": "Another Voice",
  "682f7d5c4ae9cfa71f1cc79c description": "'You've been running around quite a bit, haven't you?' This isn't the same voice as the first one, it's different. It seems content to let you think about it's rhetorical question for a bit before continuing. 'I have too, beleive it or not. Perhaps not with physical legs, running around a physical space. But I have been around this place for a while. I know it well. In fact, I have a lot to share with you, if you're willing to listen to it.",
  "682f7db8d52d88a906e1d19c": "Continue the story",
  "682f7d5c4ae9cfa71f1cc79c successMT": "(See next quest)",
  "682f7d5c4ae9cfa71f1cc79c acceptMT": "Well, maybe that staircase WILL lead me out, how do you know? ...Oh right, you're an angel. Supposedly.",

  "6a4ede1fcfd7be63ea5f80d3 name": "***Recruitment***",
  "6a4ede1fcfd7be63ea5f80d3 description": "'You see, I've too have been searching for an exit. Tarkov is not exactly the utopia I dreamed of inhabiting. This place is a slaugherhouse with no end product. All input, no output. Heh, honestly, I wonder how many souls this place can contain. But that's food for another day's thought. For now, I simply need to know something. Are you willing to work with me? I don't know what we'll find, or what we could accomplish, but surely we can do something. I'll be able to formally introduce myself as well.'",
  "6a4ede29cfd7be63ea5f80d4": "***What is your response?***",
  "6a4ede30cfd7be63ea5f80d5": "'Yes, I will work with you.'",
  "6a4ede36cfd7be63ea5f80d6": "No, I'm not working with you or any other voice.",
  "6a4ede1fcfd7be63ea5f80d3 successMT": "***Your choice is made***",
  "6a4ede1fcfd7be63ea5f80d3 acceptMT": "I diagnose the player character with Brief Psychotic Disorder.",

  "6a51ad148fcaa5fc2862548f name": "Conversation with an Otherwordly Being (5)",
  "6a51ad148fcaa5fc2862548f description": "You affirm your decision to work with this voice. 'Very good!' it replies. 'Very good. Well, I know who you are already, so, no need to tell me that. As for me... well, brace yourself. I am an angel of Heaven. I'm here on account of the fact that this place has become something very unique, somewhere almost ethereal. It...' The voice pauses. 'Hmm. It's dark out now, is it not? I feel bad having you just stand there awkwardly while I ramble. Please, make yourself comfortable.'",
  "6a51ad228fcaa5fc28625490": "Hand over any flammable material",
  "6a51ad148fcaa5fc2862548f successMT": "(Continue)",
  "6a51ad148fcaa5fc2862548f acceptMT": "Casually chatting with an otherwordly being",

  "6a51b3f08fcaa5fc28625491 name": "***Unexpected Clash***",
  "6a51b3f08fcaa5fc28625491 description": "'Any... other voice? What other...' The air grows cold around you. '𐌵ክ𐌍ል𐌌ቹ𐌃!!! YOU WILL NOT-' is the last thing you hear before two conjouned voices deafen you, and your hideout is turned into an invisible battleground. It feels like eternity passes, but a glance at the clock suggests only a second has elapsed. As suddendly as it all happens, it stops. You do not know what just happened; in fact, your mind feels unusually foggy. All you can remember is a name you could not understand, two voices that seem familiar, and a feeling that you need to choose between them.",
  "6a527ab605c248bad76ec00c": "***Which one do you choose?***",
  "6a51b3fd8fcaa5fc28625492": "Call out to the higher-pitched voice",
  "6a51e9478fcaa5fc28625494": "Call out to the lower-pitched voice",
  "6a51b3f08fcaa5fc28625491 successMT": "***Your chouce is made***",
  "6a51b3f08fcaa5fc28625491 acceptMT": "Not even the mod author knows what just happened.",

  "6a526aef05c248bad76ec005 name": "Conversation with an Otherwordly Being (7)",
  "6a526aef05c248bad76ec005 description": "You call out to the lower-pitched voice. You aren't sure how to make it clear which one you're calling out to, you just sort of... intend it towards that one. 'Well, hello again!' Seems like it could tell. It sounds out of breath, however that works for a disembodied voice 'Sorry about that, just had to fend off a demon for a moment. ... ...Ah, right... Well, time for me to explain something. You see, I am an angel of Heaven. What you just bore witness to is part of the reason I'm here, other part would be figuring out what's going on in Tarkov. I'm sure you noticed things are pretty weird here. Not like I need to convince you, your death was enough proof. There's... a lot you need to know, frankly. Do you have the time for it?'",
  "6a526afa05c248bad76ec006": "Hand over any flammable material",
  "6a526aef05c248bad76ec005 successMT": "(Continue)",
  "6a526aef05c248bad76ec005 acceptMT": "Casually chatting with an otherwordly being",

  "691dae90e22f7a5b8c337064 name": "***Never Truly Alone***",
  "691dae90e22f7a5b8c337064 description": "Almost as soon as you decide to go without that weird voice, you hear it speak again. 'Perhaps you'd prefer to work with me?' It's... not the same voice, you don't think. This one is a bit deeper, its way of speaking a bit different. You hear it speak again. 'I, uh... I'm afraid you must choose one of us. Call it the curse of this place, if you will. It won't leave you alone unless you let it control you, and the only other option is to let me protect you from it. Which, yes, will mean I'm in contact with you instead. I'll be far less annoying, I promise.' As much as you'd rather listen to neither of these voices, you conclude there truly is no other option. You're running around enough for the traders, why not throw disembodied voices into the mix? Maybe they can reward you in some way. If nothing else, maybe working with them will shut them up some.",
  "691dae943001dcf4788ec833": "***Which voice will you work with?***",
  "691db2b24b8be77912d8c359": "Return to the first voice",
  "691db2b39e5aa97f45984d2a": "Stay with this voice",
  "691dae90e22f7a5b8c337064 successMT": "***Your choice is made***",
  "691dae90e22f7a5b8c337064 acceptMT": "Seriously? I HAVE to put up with one of you? Fuck me, I guess. At least it's not both of you.",

  "691db0390b09de61b3335764 name": "Conversation with an Otherwordly Being(4)",
  "691db0390b09de61b3335764 description": "'I do believe this is the correct choice, my friend. I know I'm biased in that, but, I promise to be more useful to you, and less demanding. How can I promise that? Because I am an angel of Heaven. I have been sent to investigate this place. This aligns somewhat with your own goals, does it not? You've been trying to understand this place, or at least, find a way out. I think I can help you with that, as a matter of fact. To do that, though, we need to get to the bottom of this. I can get you primed on what I know so far, why don't you take get comfortable while I explain some things?'",
  "691db03d887227181386679d": "Hand over any flammable material",
  "691db0390b09de61b3335764 successMT": "'Glad to see you sticking around. Hope you don't mind more of my ranting.'",
  "691db0390b09de61b3335764 acceptMT": "Casually chatting with an otherwordly being",

  "6904c85911fc5239a64470bb name": "A Story by the Fire",
  "6904c85911fc5239a64470bb description": "'Where do I begin... well, you know the tale of Tarkov better than most, since your company sent you here. You know about TerraGroup, you know the conflict, you probably know the result to some extent... but, you might not know much about the aftermath of these events. You see, ever since a, uh... 'special event' happened a few weeks ago, everything's been all messed up. Those who die come back to life. Those who could leave, don't. Tarkov still takes in new people, but doesn't seem to export any. I don't know what the outside world thinks is happening here, but there doesn't seem to be much intervention. Perhaps a space-time distortion of sorts? Who knows anymore... once the dead are raised, nothing's off the table. Anyways, I've been here watching ever since that 'event' transpired. I've been trying to understand what's going on, much like yourself. I haven't made much progress, unfortunatenly; there's only so much I can do by watching, and no one seems to hear me. Well, nobody but you. That works out great for me, I can conduct much better investigations with your help. Of course, that's if you're willing to help me. You can think about it, I'm in no rush. I'll be sure to make it worth your while. On that note, I have been talking for a while, haven't I. My apologies. Take the rest of the day off, you've had a wild introduction to this place. I'll be here if you need something.'",
  "6904c85e75c9ec35cc48f924": "Thank you for listening'",
  "6904c85911fc5239a64470bb successMT": "You feel the presence fade. Something tells you it should return eventually.",
  "6904c85911fc5239a64470bb acceptMT": "That 'event' a few weeks ago, I heard about something like that... some blue light?",

  //End chapter 1 locale

  //Begin chapter 2 locale

  "69f54025b287147c5fb46bb2 name": "Investigation",
  "69f54025b287147c5fb46bb2 description": "'Hello again. I've been continuing to watch over this place, I wanted to find some sort of lead before asking you to run around for me. I've been seeing a very particular group running around this place. Hooded robes, only active at night, meeting places. Something tells me this is more than just a weird PMC group. I bet they know something we don't. Could you visit one of their meeting places, by chance? Let me know if you see anything.'",
  "69f54034b287147c5fb46bb3": "Visit any of the Cultist gathering spots",
  "6a52a24f611b218c671def63": "Dorm 316 (Customs)",
  "6a52a25a611b218c671def64": "W316 (Shoreline)",
  "6a52a264611b218c671def65": "Circle @ Cultist Village (Woods)",
  "6a52a26b611b218c671def66": "Circle near Sawmill (Woods)",
  "6a52a273611b218c671def67": "Marked room 1 (Reserve)",
  "6a52a27a611b218c671def68": "Marked room 2 (Reserve)",
  "6a52a281611b218c671def69": "Marked room 3 (Reserve)",
  "6a52a287611b218c671def6a": "Abandoned Factory (Streets)",
  "6a52a28e611b218c671def6b": "Chek 13 (Streets)",
  "69f54025b287147c5fb46bb2 successMT": "'Describe the symbol again for me? And the members of this group, this is where that knife you showed me came from? ...hmm. You thinking what I'm think? I think we got a cult on our hands. Speaking of thinking, I'm gonna go do that for a bit.'",
  "69f54025b287147c5fb46bb2 acceptMT": "Because you totally haven't done 'The Cult - Part 2' by now.",

  "6a0bc12f660f2e4f6eca1b70 name": "Grabbing Their Attention",
  "6a0bc12f660f2e4f6eca1b70 description": "'I was debating how we could best gather more infomration about this group, and honestly? Why take some weird side route and stalk them from a distance? Let's just learn from the source. We need to get their attention without angering them. I've seen various offerings at their sites before, though they seem to be anonymous gifts. I wonder if we could leave something there that would make it obvious it's us, something that's clear it's a sign, not a gift? That might get them interested in us.'",
  "6a0bc177660f2e4f6eca1b71": "Leave something unique at one of the cultist spots",
  "6a0bc187660f2e4f6eca1b72": "Hint: Something you often use to mark locations for other tasks",
  "6a0bc12f660f2e4f6eca1b70 successMT": "You left a literal marker there? Interesting choice. Well, I'll keep watch for ya. Let's see what they do with it.' (TIMEGATE: 1 hour)",
  "6a0bc12f660f2e4f6eca1b70 acceptMT": "Hint: Something you often use to mark locations for other tasks",

  "6a0bc20c660f2e4f6eca1b73 name": "***Interested***",
  "6a0bc20c660f2e4f6eca1b73 description": "Alright, got some news for you. They saw your marker and they seem to know that it was you, they reported it as 'the one' leaving them a notice. They seem to have been interested in you for a long time. Do you have friends you haven't told me about? I kid, I kid. This is a fascinating development, though. I'm curious, too. What do you think we should do next?'",
  "6a0bc23e660f2e4f6eca1b74": "*Make a choice*",
  "6a0bc24d660f2e4f6eca1b75": "They've been expecting me, I want to talk to them",
  "6a0bc257660f2e4f6eca1b76": "I'm not sure yet / let's wait.",
  "6a0bc261660f2e4f6eca1b77": "You tell me. You're the one having me run around.",
  "6a0bc20c660f2e4f6eca1b73 successMT": "**Your choice is made**",
  "6a0bc20c660f2e4f6eca1b73 acceptMT": "We're back to making choices again :/",

  "6a0bc26f660f2e4f6eca1b78 name": "Casually Walking Into a Cult",
  "6a0bc26f660f2e4f6eca1b78 description": "'You want to talk to them?' The voice hesitates. 'Hmm. That would be going straight to the source, wouldn't it? Well, let's leave them a note, then. To make sure no one else picks it up, let's do it at an indoor location.' You think you hear the voice chuckle a bit.",
  "6a0bc27f660f2e4f6eca1b79": "Place the note at an indoor cultist location",
  "6a0bc26f660f2e4f6eca1b78 successMT": "'I'll keep watch for you again. Let's see what happens.' (TIMEGATE: 1hr)",
  "6a0bc26f660f2e4f6eca1b78 acceptMT": "'It's a bold strategy cotton, let's see how it plays out for him' -Dodgeball",

  "6a0bc287660f2e4f6eca1b7a name": "Waiting",
  "6a0bc287660f2e4f6eca1b7a description": "'You want to wait a bit? See if they approach you, maybe? Alright, let's give it a day and see what happens.",
  "6a0bc294660f2e4f6eca1b7b": "Well, you said you wanted to wait.",
  "6a0bc287660f2e4f6eca1b7a successMT": "(TIMEGATE: 18hr)",
  "6a0bc287660f2e4f6eca1b7a acceptMT": "I mean, we're just waiting...",

  "6a0bc2ae660f2e4f6eca1b7c name": "Curious Light's Opinion",
  "6a0bc2ae660f2e4f6eca1b7c description": "'Oh, you want me to decide?' The voice pauses for a moment. 'Well, they seem to be acutely aware of you. From what I saw of their reaction, they weren't frightened or angered. They were excited. So, I think they'd be friendly to you. Though, I know just walking up to them mid-raid could go poorly... hmm. We should let them know that you're coming. Is it too old school to leave a note for them?'",
  "6a0bc2bb660f2e4f6eca1b7d": "Place the note at an indoor cultist location",
  "6a0bc2ae660f2e4f6eca1b7c successMT": "'I'll keep watch for you again. Let's see what happens.' (TIMEGATE: 1hr)",
  "6a0bc2ae660f2e4f6eca1b7c acceptMT": "It would be old school if we had any wifi in this place... damn EMP.",

  "6a0bc33e660f2e4f6eca1b7e name": "***Noted***",
  "6a0bc33e660f2e4f6eca1b7e description": "On your way out of the hideout today, you nearly step on a note someone left outside your door. It bears a symbol you recognize well. It reads as follows: \"You lack initiative. You risk missing your part in the play. You need us, and we need you. We will not waste our time again if you are not interested. If you want to back out, make that clear. To discard or lose this note will be taken as such an answer. If, however, you want to speak to us, leave this note at W316.\" (If you choose to place the note, bring it in your pouch: You will not be able to get another copy of it if you lose it.)",
  "6a0bc34f660f2e4f6eca1b7f": "***Make a choice***",
  "6a0bd526660f2e4f6eca1b80": "Back out (kill a cultist)",
  "6a0bd533660f2e4f6eca1b81": "Bring the note to W316.",
  "6a0bc33e660f2e4f6eca1b7e successMT": "**Your choice is made**",
  "6a0bc33e660f2e4f6eca1b7e acceptMT": "Uh-oh",

  "6a0bd6f5660f2e4f6eca1b82 name": "Backed Out",
  "6a0bd6f5660f2e4f6eca1b82 description": "As you return to your hideout after making yourself clear, you realize it's been a while since you've heared the voice. You begin to wonder if it's still there at all, or if it has left you alone. ...alone for now, at least. With no voices in your head telling you where to go, you feel strangely aimless, even though you know survival is the most important thing. Perhaps you can find something to do?'",
  "6a0bd6ff660f2e4f6eca1b83": "Complete 15 raids",
  "6a0bd6f5660f2e4f6eca1b82 successMT": "Nothing... changes. You feel no closer to escaping. You feel no closer to figuring things out. All these quests for the other traders, but what actually changes? What actually happens? What tangible difference can you say you've made in this place? You are going insane. (TIMEGATE: 1 minute)",
  "6a0bd6f5660f2e4f6eca1b82 acceptMT": "...",

  "6a0c07022f158ea67c6f1a34 name": "***Fate***",
  "6a0c07022f158ea67c6f1a34 description": "You hear a knocking on your door. You check the security feed: Nobody there, but a note is taped to your door. You recognize the cultist symbol scrawled on it. With nothing better to do, you grab it and open it up. The note is written in all caps, and reads as follows: \"DECIDER OF FATE. YOU DO NOT UNDERSTAND THE ROLE YOU ARE ABANDONING. TARKOV WILL REMAIN IN PURGATORY WITHOUT YOUR ACTIONS. YOU HAVE TWO OPTIONS: WORK WITH US, OR BE TORMENTED BY US FOREVER. WE WILL NOT TOLERATE YOUR LACK OF ACTION. SEE THE CONSEQUENCES OF YOUR NEGLECT.\" You notice a dogtag taped to the back of the note. It's yours. \"WE AWAIT YOUR RESPONSE. SPEAK IT ALOUD, AND WE WILL HEAR IT.\"",
  "6a0c070b2f158ea67c6f1a35": "***Cultist work or endless torment...***",
  "6a0c0e9f2f158ea67c6f1a36": "I think I'll just work for them.",
  "6a0c0ea82f158ea67c6f1a37": "Endless torment sounds great, actually. I will continue doing nothing.",
  "6a0c0eb22f158ea67c6f1a38": "These can't be the only two options. Is there a third?",
  "6a0c07022f158ea67c6f1a34 successMT": "***Your choice is made***",
  "6a0c07022f158ea67c6f1a34 acceptMT": "Grand Order.",

  "6a0c11122f158ea67c6f1a4a name": "Hello Again",
  "6a0c11122f158ea67c6f1a4a description": "The moment you think to yourself 'I haven't heard from that voice in my head for a while', it speaks to you. \"Hey, been a minute. I was getting some stuff done on my end, sorry for the delay.\" You are about to ask what stuff a voice could have to do, but it continues too quickly. \"Tell me, tell me! What's been happening in my absence?' You inform him of your run in with, and decision to work for, the cultists. You feel a sense of joy eminating from the voice, somehow. It only grows the more you tell him, until it cannot contain itself anymore. \"This is incredibly exciting. You not only got to speak with them, but you're actually now one of them??? Or, working for them, sorry. My gosh, that's an incredible development. They hold so many secrets, and now we can slowly learn them right from their own mouths. I'm proud of you, kid. \" He pauses for a moment. \"Well, I guess we wait for them to contact you again, right?\"",
  "6a0c111b2f158ea67c6f1a4b": "'Yep. Just waiting around.'",
  "6a0c11122f158ea67c6f1a4a successMT": "\"Alrighty then. Keep me posted, k?\" (TIMEGATE: 12 hours)",
  "6a0c11122f158ea67c6f1a4a acceptMT": "A voice can only dissapear so long, I suppose.",


  //multi choice
  "CLMC_NM name": "NAME (Choice, 'QUESTNAME')",
  "CLMC_NM description": "Completing this quest will make the following choice: (CHOICE) for the following quest: (QUEST)",
  "CLMC_NMtaskN": "Click 'Turn In' to make your choice...",
  "CLMC_NM successMT": "You have turned in a choice for the following quest: (QUEST). That quest should now be ready for completion. Please return to that quest and turn it it.",
  //Chapter 1 MC
  "6a4edde0cfd7be63ea5f80cf name": "Yes, work for this voice (Choice, 'Recruitment')",
  "6a4edde0cfd7be63ea5f80cf description": "Completing this quest will make the following choice: (Yes, I will work for you) for the following quest: (Recruitment)",
  "6a4eddeecfd7be63ea5f80d0": "Click 'Turn In' to make your choice...",
  "6a4edde0cfd7be63ea5f80cf successMT": "You have turned in a choice for the following quest: (Recruitment). That quest should now be ready for completion. Please return to that quest and turn it it.",

  "6a4eddf7cfd7be63ea5f80d1 name": "No, work for no voices (Choice, 'Recruitment')",
  "6a4eddf7cfd7be63ea5f80d1 description": "Completing this quest will make the following choice: (No, I'm not working with you or any other voice) for the following quest: (Recruitment)",
  "6a4eddfecfd7be63ea5f80d2": "Click 'Turn In' to make your choice...",
  "6a4eddf7cfd7be63ea5f80d1 successMT": "You have turned in a choice for the following quest: (Recruitment). That quest should now be ready for completion. Please return to that quest and turn it it.",

  "6a52867799ec51dc30287f99 name": "Call out to the higher-pitched voice (Choice, 'Unexpected Clash')",
